<module #examples.server apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "module" depends_on = ["depa-ontology" "elysia" "@elysiajs/cors"] behaviors = ["behavior://example-viz/requirements/example-server"] } [
  <desc ?01M1W0XR6QXQ50SMXA1XAVXAW6>
  Bun/Elysia 示例后端：把浏览器请求适配为 depa-ontology 与 CozoDB 调用，不拥有 native binding 或本体运行时实现。
  </?01M1W0XR6QXQ50SMXA1XAVXAW6>
  <capsule-tree ?tree>
  packages/example-server/
    package.json                         # 私有 workspace 包；声明 dev/start/test 与 depa-ontology 依赖
    README.md                            # 启动方式、端口和平台约束
    src/index.js                         # createApp、API endpoints、数据库生命周期与 registry 串行化
    src/helpers.js                       # 工作表数据到 ontology batch 的纯转换辅助
    src/demos/index.js                   # 示例目录与 demo id 索引
    src/demos/*.js                       # 六组领域示例、默认表与查询定义
    src/demos/*.test.js                  # temporal 和 behavior 示例的 Bun 验收
    src/permission/models.js             # 直接 CozoDB 权限模型与查询
    src/*-api.test.js                    # schema、governance 与 integrity API 验收
  </?tree>
  <not-owned-here ?01M1W0XR6QXQ50SMXA1XAVXAW7>
  depa-cozo 负责 native loading；depa-ontology 负责对象模型、治理、schema 和 Datalog API。
  </?01M1W0XR6QXQ50SMXA1XAVXAW7>
]>

<module #examples.browser apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "module" depends_on = ["modeling://domain/examples/server" "vue" "vite" "@playwright/test"] behaviors = ["behavior://example-viz/requirements/example-browser" "behavior://example-viz/requirements/browser-e2e"] } [
  <desc ?01M1W0XR6RS04BP49ZJDSBJ6FG>
  Vue/Vite 示例展示面及其 Playwright 验收所有者；通过 HTTP API 消费 example-server，不直接加载 native 或 ontology 包。
  </?01M1W0XR6RS04BP49ZJDSBJ6FG>
  <capsule-tree ?tree>
  packages/example-browser/
    package.json                         # 私有 workspace 包；声明 dev/build/preview/e2e scripts
    README.md                            # browser、server 与 e2e 的运行说明
    index.html                           # Vite HTML 入口
    vite.config.ts                       # Vue plugin 与 4174 开发端口
    tsconfig.json                        # Vue/TypeScript 编译配置
    src/main.ts                          # Vue 应用入口
    src/router.ts                        # ontology、permission、governance、schema 路由
    src/lib/api.ts                       # 4175 API client 和响应类型
    src/components/*.vue                 # 表格、树、图、查询和 workbook 展示组件
    src/pages/*.vue                      # 四个交互式示例页面
    playwright.config.ts                 # 跨 workspace 启动 server/browser 的 Chromium 配置
    e2e/*.pw.ts                          # demo、permission、schema、governance、integrity 端到端验收
  </?tree>
  <not-owned-here ?01M1W0XR6RS04BP49ZJDSBJ6FH>
  HTTP API 实现与数据库生命周期属于 example-server；本体行为属于 depa-ontology。
  </?01M1W0XR6RS04BP49ZJDSBJ6FH>
]>
